#: src/gtk/window.ui:608
msgid ""
"For lossy encoding, this controls image quality. For lossless encoding, this "
"controls the effort and time spent in compression. Range is 0 to 100. "
"Default is 75."
msgstr ""

#: src/gtk/window.ui:625
msgid ""
"Warning!\n"
"This value overrides other settings"
msgstr ""

#: src/gtk/window.ui:627
msgid "Preset"
msgstr ""

#: src/gtk/window.ui:628
msgid ""
"This does some automatic settings based on the general type of the image.\n"
"None: Do not use a preset.\n"
"Default: Use the encoder default.\n"
"Picture: Digital picture, like portrait, inner shot.\n"
"Photo: Outdoor photograph, with natural lighting.\n"
"Drawing: Hand or line drawing, with high-contrast details.\n"
"Icon: Small-sized colorful images.\n"
"Text: Text-like."
msgstr ""

#: src/gtk/window.ui:649
msgid "Adjusts quality and speed tradeoff"
msgstr ""

#: src/gtk/window.ui:650
msgid "Compression level"
msgstr ""

#: src/gtk/window.ui:651
msgid ""
"For lossy, this is a quality/speed tradeoff. Higher values give better "
"quality for a given size at the cost of increased encoding time. For "
"lossless, this is a size/speed tradeoff. Higher values give smaller size at "
"the cost of increased encoding time. More specifically, it controls the "
"number of extra algorithms and compression tools used, and varies the "
"combination of these tools. This maps to the method option in libwebp. The "
"valid range is 0 to 6. Default is 4."
msgstr ""

#: src/gtk/window.ui:676
msgid "Constant rate factor"
msgstr ""

#: src/gtk/window.ui:678
msgid ""
"Constant rate factor (CRF). Lower values mean better quality and a larger "
"file, higher values mean worse quality and a smaller file. The valid range "
"is 0 to 63. Default is 30."
msgstr ""

#: src/gtk/window.ui:692
msgid "Quality / speed tradeoff"
msgstr ""

#: src/gtk/window.ui:693
msgid "Speed"
msgstr ""

#: src/gtk/window.ui:694
msgid ""
"Quality / speed tradeoff (cpu-used). Higher values give faster encoding at "
"the cost of quality. The valid range is 0 to 8. Default is 6."
msgstr ""

